<title>INDIA: Indian yr/yr inflation rises to 6.02 pct in week.</title>
<headline>Indian yr/yr inflation rises to 6.02 pct in week.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-09-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's year-on-year inflation rate measured by the wholesale price index rose to 6.02 percent in the week ending September 7 from 5.94 percent in the previous week, the Industry Ministry said on Sunday.</p>
<p>    WHOLESALE PRICES	 Sept 7	 Aug 31     Sept 9, 1995</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change    +6.02	  +5.94	    +8.74</p>
<p>    Index (base=1981/82)  315.4	  314.1	    297.5</p>
<p>Note - Figures are preliminary except for those for week ended September 9, 1995.</p>
</text>
